<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 588.94, down 1.01.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 271 to 246.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,307,340 compared with 24,943,540 Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
